{"repositoryId":1190560481,"availability":"available","full":"ackness/covel","name":"covel","description":"[Agentic AI-RPG Framework] Agentic AI role-playing game framework — narration, NPCs, lore, and character creation are autonomous plugin agents. Build interactive fiction with any AI provider.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":57,"forks":20,"created":"2026-03-24T12:01:50Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:47:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://covel.cc/","topics":["agentic-ai","ai-agent","ai-dungeon","ai-dungeon-master","ai-rpg","ai-storytelling","deepseek","dungeon","galgame","harness","interactive-fiction","multi-agent","role-playing-game","sillytavern","text-adventure"],"demo":"https://covel.cc/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:33.751Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:33.751Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:33.751Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:33.751Z","stars":57,"forks":20}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A modular, agentic AI RPG. Compose mechanics as plugins and ship settings as portable world packs.","[](./docs/CHANGELOG.md#0051---2026-10-12) [](./LICENSE) [](./docs/CHANGELOG.md) [](","Covel is an AI RPG framework and playable studio where NPC relationships, lore, quests, inventory, memory, stage direction, and media can evolve between turns. Its architecture has three clear layers: the kernel provides primitives and orchestration, plugins provide behavior, and world packs provide settings, resources, and a default plugin composition."],"features":["🎭 Stage mode — a full-screen visual novel: scene backdrops, character sprites, typewriter dialog, and choice overlays. Backdrops come from the world pack's scene art; a location without one shows the world image.…","⚙️ Composable plugin runtimes — combine LLM agents, deterministic functions, UI panels, data schemas, events, and lifecycle hooks in one capability-driven pipeline.","🎲 RPG mechanics built in — pre-rolled dice checks with visible receipts, an auto-tracked quest log, a player-managed inventory, and per-NPC affinity meters. All optional plugins; worlds can seed quests, gear, and…","🧩 Plugins stay replaceable — the kernel resolves versioned contracts and declared output visibility; framework code does not branch on concrete plugin IDs.","🎲 Optional point-buy rules — tabletop-rules uses the same typed forms, validators and deterministic tools available to third-party ZIP packages. Narration perspective is configurable in both narrative plugins; prose…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ackness/covel/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3b4d61b991d87aedaeaf3e8eb7bce777563a3e5fd1da3a4a29e5579a3b3ae37c","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:33.908Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:33.908Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A modular, agentic AI RPG. Compose mechanics as plugins and ship settings as portable world packs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ackness/covel/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"3b4d61b991d87aedaeaf3e8eb7bce777563a3e5fd1da3a4a29e5579a3b3ae37c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ackness/covel/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:33.909Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T14:47:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ackness/covel/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:33.910Z","hash":"3b4d61b991d87aedaeaf3e8eb7bce777563a3e5fd1da3a4a29e5579a3b3ae37c","originalBytes":24448,"storedBytes":24448,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["world","docs","plugin","plugins","worlds","data","one","reference","runtime","stage","without","covel","guide","assets","images","model","pack","package","text","language","memory","readme","rules","session","tools","before","contracts","mode","own","quests","characters","media","runtimes","separate","settings","ship","what","affinity","agent","english","events","kernel","macos